# One line per real person in `git shortlog -sne`. It only changes how authors are displayed.
# (On 2026-11-04 the owner had the history of osionos, groot and grobase rewritten to drop
# co-author trailers; authors and dates were kept, so this file still applies.)
#
# Submodules have no copy of their own; read them through this one:
#   scripts/contributors.sh            (root and every app submodule)
#   git -C apps/grobase -c mailmap.file="$PWD/.mailmap" shortlog -sne --all
#
# Caveat: two author/email pairs mix two members and are resolved by inference, not by
# proof (see the README, "Individual Contributions"). A new address a member starts
# committing with shows up as an extra line until it is added here.

